{"qid": "mt_00031_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0031", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 38.26, "n_tokens": 230, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.3846, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 346, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.38", "answer": "《劳动合同法》没有失效，目前仍然有效。\n\n《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》于2007年6月29日通过，2008年1月1日起施行，后于2012年12月28日修正，现行有效。您所涉的未签书面劳动合同二倍工资、经济补偿等问题，仍适用该法。\n\n需要说明的是，我上一条回复中引用的《劳动合同法》第八十二条内容被截断了，完整表述应为：\n\n《劳动合同法》第八十二条：用人单位自用工之日起超过一个月不满一年未与劳动者订立书面劳动合同的，应当向劳动者每月支付二倍的工资。用人单位违反本法规定不与劳动者订立无固定期限劳动合同的，自应当订立无固定期限劳动合同之日起向劳动者每月支付二倍的工资。\n\n另外，关于您提到的“协商一致解除劳动合同、经济补偿计算基数与年限、月工资高于当地上年度职工月平均工资三倍”的情形，适用的是", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.037, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）浙01民终2387号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）浙01民终2387号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民终1512号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民终1512号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2024）闽01民再2723号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2024）闽01民再2723号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民再2753号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民再2753号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民再1832号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民再1832号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）沪01民终2384号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）沪01民终2384号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）粤01民终2542号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）粤01民终2542号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）浙01民终2367号_0", "score": 0.1288, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）浙01民终2367号"}]}}}
{"qid": "mt_00039_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0039", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 40.27, "n_tokens": 242, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.3846, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 363, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.38", "answer": "《劳动合同法》没有失效，目前仍然有效。\n\n需要说明的是：我上一条回复中引用的“第八十二条”内容有误，特此更正。《劳动合同法》第八十二条的准确内容是：\n\n> 用人单位自用工之日起超过一个月不满一年未与劳动者订立书面劳动合同的，应当向劳动者每月支付二倍的工资。\n> 用人单位违反本法规定不与劳动者订立无固定期限劳动合同的，自应当订立无固定期限劳动合同之日起向劳动者每月支付二倍的工资。\n\n（来源：《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》第八十二条）\n\n另外提示：您本组问题（g0039）的核心是**加班费**，与第八十二条（未签书面合同的二倍工资）并非同一事项。加班费的直接依据是《劳动法》第四十四条（延长工作时间支付不低于150%工资报酬、休息日安排工作又不能补休的支付不低于200%、法定休假日安排工作的支付不低于300%）。如需，我可以", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.039, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2022）苏05民再395号_0", "score": 0.1286, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）苏05民再395号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）苏05民再1832号_0", "score": 0.1286, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）苏05民再1832号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2021）鲁01民终1939号_0", "score": 0.1286, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2021）鲁01民终1939号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2022）浙01民终2387号_0", "score": 0.1214, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2022）浙01民终2387号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2025）浙01民终1512号_0", "score": 0.1214, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2025）浙01民终1512号"}, {"doc_id": "jd_（2019）苏05民终957号_0", "score": 0.1214, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, 