{"qid": "mt_00077_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "alwaysrag", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0077", "gold_pass": null, "correct": true, "retrieval_used": true, "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 30.48, "n_tokens": 220, "u": null, "tau_b": null, "tau": null, "channel": "always", "gate_source": null, "router_mode": null, "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.4545, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 330, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.45", "answer": "《民法典》并未失效，目前仍然有效。\n\n《中华人民共和国民法典》自2021年1月1日起施行，至今现行有效。此前我引用的第七百一十六条（转租）等条文均属现行有效规定。\n\n需要说明的是：我上一条回答中关于“提前退租适用第七百一十六条”的表述并不准确。第七百一十六条规范的是**转租**，与提前退租并非同一问题。提前退租主要涉及：\n\n- **合同解除与违约责任**：依《民法典》第五百六十二条、第五百六十三条（协商解除、法定解除）及第五百七十七条（违约责任）处理；\n- **租赁期限届满后继续使用**：依《民法典》第七百三十四条，租赁期限届满，承租人继续使用租赁物，出租人没有提出异议的，原租赁合同继续有效，但租赁期限为不定期；不定期租赁当事人可以随时解除，但应在合理", "trace": {"channel": "always", "n_retrieval_calls": 1, "retrieval": {"top_k": 8, "reranked": true, "seconds": 0.029, "backend": "chromadb", "embed_backend": "bge-small-zh-v1.5", "hits": [{"doc_id": "jd_（2020）津02民终252号_0", "score": 0.6968, "type": "judgment", "law": null, "article": null, "case_no": "（2020）津02民终252号"}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_153", "score": 0.2523, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 153, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_3", "score": 0.2498, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 3, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典时间效力规定_2020_2", "score": 0.2485, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典时间效力规定", "article": 2, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_146", "score": 0.2406, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 146, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_157", "score": 0.2397, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典", "article": 157, "case_no": null}, {"doc_id": "lp_民法典_2020_144", "score": 0.2268, "type": "provision", "law": "民法典",